voxagent reimplements Puppet's catalog apply behaviour in Go. Its behaviour,
messages and report format are derived from Puppet 8.10.0's source, which the
code cites by path and line. No Puppet source file is redistributed
unmodified.

voxagent's native concat (internal/ral/concat*.go) likewise reproduces the
behaviour and messages of puppetlabs-concat 9.1.0 and 10.0.1 ("Puppet Module -
puppetlabs-concat, Copyright 2018 Puppet, Inc."), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. The four type files of puppetlabs-concat 9.1.0 and 10.0.1
(concat_file.rb and concat_fragment.rb of each) are redistributed unmodified as
test fixtures under internal/ral/testdata/concat; they remain under the Apache
License, Version 2.0, a copy of which is in LICENSE.md.

